   "notes": "Lion Yard, Petty Cury frontage (OSM addr St Tibbs Row). 1970s shopping-centre range: ground floor of shop units behind square cream-rendered piers (modelled as pilasters) with projecting hanging signs; above, alternating red-brown brick piers and tall glazed bays set in white frames; flat brick parapet. Only one reference photo (2010, raking view from the east end); bay rhythm (~6.5 m) estimated, fascia text left blank as there are no OSM shop POIs for the individual units."
